  id: lvDysfunctions
  title: Dysfunctions
  author: LivreVerte
  description: "\"How do you get 23 from 1 and 2. Wait, don't worry it's 3 now.\"
    \nQuery inputs into the base 6 module to determine the base 6 function and metafunction
    while restrictions limit your query options. \nA module inspired by Functions
    and Malfunctions by JerryEris in both the basic premise and name. \nManual is
    located in ktane.timwi.de or the manuals folder in your game. \nThis is a first
    module attempt, and while I am happy with where it is, I recognize that there
    will be bugs. Contact LivreVerte on Discord for concerns or bugs. "
